  "ia-tolstoy-war-and-peace": "Tolstoy's War and Peace in Clara Bell's version from the French (Gottsberger, 1885-87, six volumes): five are open on archive.org (warpeacehistoric01tols, 02tols, 04tols, 06tols; warandpeaceahis01paskgoog and others), but no scan of The Invasion, vol. I with her name was found. The Vizetelly London 'Invasion' (india.history.resource.73511) names no translator. Waits for the missing volume.",
